{"seq":1,"slug":"acid-vs-base","title":"ACID 与 BASE：事务语义对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/acid-vs-base","wordCount":1195,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"acid-与-base-事务语义对比\">ACID 与 BASE：事务语义对比</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>ACID 和 BASE 是数据系统中两种对立的事务语义模型。ACID 源自关系型数据库的严格正确性保证，BASE 则是分布式系统为了可扩展性而做出的务实妥协。理解两者的精确语义、隔离级别的细微差异、以及它们之间的渐变关系，是做出正确数据一致性设计决策的基础。</p>\n<p>本文从 ACID 四大特性的精确定义出发，深入分析各隔离级别的异常现象，然后对比 BASE 模型的设计哲学，帮助工程师建立完整的事务语义认知框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"acid-特性精确定义\">ACID 特性精确定义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见误解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Atomicity (原子性)</td>\n<td>事务要么全部成功，要么全部回滚</td>\n<td>不是指&quot;同时执行&quot;，而是指&quot;不可分割&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consistency (一致性)</td>\n<td>事务将数据库从一个有效状态转移到另一个有效状态</td>\n<td>是应用层属性，不完全由数据库保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Isolation (隔离性)</td>\n<td>并发事务互不干扰，如同串行执行</td>\n<td>实际中通过隔离级别进行弱化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Durability (持久性)</td>\n<td>已提交事务的数据不会丢失</td>\n<td>受限于硬件故障范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"隔离级别与异常现象\">隔离级别与异常现象</h3><p>SQL 标准定义了四个隔离级别，每个级别允许不同的并发异常：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离级别</th>\n<th>脏读</th>\n<th>不可重复读</th>\n<th>幻读</th>\n<th>写倾斜</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Read Uncommitted</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read Committed</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repeatable Read</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Serializable</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>异常现象详解：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 脏读 (Dirty Read): 读到未提交的数据&#10;-- Transaction 1:&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = 0 WHERE id = 1;  -- 未提交&#10;-- Transaction 2:&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;  -- 读到 0 (脏数据)&#10;-- Transaction 1:&#10;ROLLBACK;  -- 回滚了!&#10;&#10;-- 不可重复读 (Non-repeatable Read): 同一事务内两次读取结果不同&#10;-- Transaction 1:&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;  -- 返回 1000&#10;-- Transaction 2: COMMIT(UPDATE balance = 500 WHERE id = 1)&#10;-- Transaction 1:&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;  -- 返回 500 (变了!)&#10;&#10;-- 幻读 (Phantom Read): 同一条件两次查询返回不同行集&#10;-- Transaction 1:&#10;SELECT * FROM bookings WHERE room = &#39;A&#39; AND time = &#39;10:00&#39;;  -- 0 行&#10;-- Transaction 2: INSERT (room=&#39;A&#39;, time=&#39;10:00&#39;) + COMMIT&#10;-- Transaction 1:&#10;SELECT * FROM bookings WHERE room = &#39;A&#39; AND time = &#39;10:00&#39;;  -- 1 行!&#10;&#10;-- 写倾斜 (Write Skew): 两个事务各自读取后做出冲突写入&#10;-- 约束: 至少一个医生在值班&#10;-- Transaction 1: SELECT count(*) FROM on_call → 2; UPDATE SET off_call WHERE id=1&#10;-- Transaction 2: SELECT count(*) FROM on_call → 2; UPDATE SET off_call WHERE id=2&#10;-- 两个事务都成功提交 → 没有医生在值班! (违反约束)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 脏读 (Dirty Read): 读到未提交的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 未提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 2:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 读到 0 (脏数据)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 回滚了!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不可重复读 (Non-repeatable Read): 同一事务内两次读取结果不同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 2: COMMIT(UPDATE balance = 500 WHERE id = 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回 500 (变了!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 幻读 (Phantom Read): 同一条件两次查询返回不同行集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bookings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> room </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> time</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10:00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 0 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 2: INSERT (room='A', time='10:00') + COMMIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bookings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> room </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> time</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10:00'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1 行!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 写倾斜 (Write Skew): 两个事务各自读取后做出冲突写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 约束: 至少一个医生在值班</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 1: SELECT count(*) FROM on_call → 2; UPDATE SET off_call WHERE id=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Transaction 2: SELECT count(*) FROM on_call → 2; UPDATE SET off_call WHERE id=2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 两个事务都成功提交 → 没有医生在值班! (违反约束)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可序列化实现方案\">可序列化实现方案</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>吞吐量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真正串行执行</td>\n<td>单线程顺序执行事务</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>VoltDB, Redis 事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两阶段锁定 (2PL)</td>\n<td>读锁和写锁，执行完才释放</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>MySQL InnoDB (Serializable)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可序列化快照隔离 (SSI)</td>\n<td>乐观并发+冲突检测</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL, CockroachDB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>SSI (Serializable Snapshot Isolation) 原理：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 事务开始时获取一致性快照 (与 MVCC 相同)&#10;2. 事务正常执行读写 (不加锁)&#10;3. 提交时检测冲突:&#10;   - 检查读取的数据是否被其他已提交事务修改&#10;   - 检查写入的数据是否与其他事务的读取条件冲突&#10;4. 如果检测到冲突 → 中止事务 (乐观中止)&#10;5. 如果无冲突 → 提交成功&#10;&#10;优点: 读不阻塞写，写不阻塞读，吞吐量远高于 2PL&#10;缺点: 高冲突场景下中止率高\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 事务开始时获取一致性快照 (与 MVCC 相同)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 事务正常执行读写 (不加锁)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 提交时检测冲突:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 检查读取的数据是否被其他已提交事务修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 检查写入的数据是否与其他事务的读取条件冲突</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 如果检测到冲突 → 中止事务 (乐观中止)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 如果无冲突 → 提交成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优点: 读不阻塞写，写不阻塞读，吞吐量远高于 2PL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缺点: 高冲突场景下中止率高</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"base-模型\">BASE 模型</h3><p>BASE 是 Eric Brewer 提出的与 ACID 对立的设计哲学：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程体现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Basically Available</td>\n<td>系统基本可用，允许部分失败</td>\n<td>降级、限流而非停服</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Soft state</td>\n<td>状态可以有中间态</td>\n<td>副本间允许短暂不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eventually consistent</td>\n<td>最终所有副本收敛到一致状态</td>\n<td>异步复制、后台修复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>ACID vs BASE 并非二元对立：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;ACID: Strong Consistency&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Causal Consistency&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Read-your-writes&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Monotonic Reads&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;BASE: Eventual Consistency&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"ACID: Strong Consistency\"] --&gt; B[\"Causal Consistency\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Read-your-writes\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Monotonic Reads\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"BASE: Eventual Consistency\"]</pre><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"mvcc-多版本并发控制-实现\">MVCC（多版本并发控制）实现</h3><p>大多数现代数据库使用 MVCC 实现 Read Committed 和 Repeatable Read：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class MVCCStore:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;简化的 MVCC 实现&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.data = {}  # key → [(version, value, committed)]&#10;        self.tx_counter = 0&#10;        self.active_txns = set()&#10;&#10;    def begin_transaction(self):&#10;        self.tx_counter += 1&#10;        tx_id = self.tx_counter&#10;        self.active_txns.add(tx_id)&#10;        # 快照: 记录事务开始时所有活跃事务&#10;        snapshot = self.active_txns.copy()&#10;        return Transaction(tx_id, snapshot, self)&#10;&#10;    def read(self, key, tx):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;读取对当前事务可见的最新版本&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        if key not in self.data:&#10;            return None&#10;        for version, value, committed_by in reversed(self.data[key]):&#10;            if self._is_visible(committed_by, tx):&#10;                return value&#10;        return None&#10;&#10;    def _is_visible(self, committed_by, tx):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;判断某版本是否对当前事务可见&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        if committed_by == tx.tx_id:&#10;            return True  # 自己写的总可见&#10;        if committed_by in tx.snapshot:&#10;            return False  # 事务开始时仍活跃 → 不可见&#10;        if committed_by &gt; tx.tx_id:&#10;            return False  # 后于自己开始的事务 → 不可见&#10;        return True  # 已提交且早于自己 → 可见\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MVCCStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"简化的 MVCC 实现\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># key → [(version, value, committed)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tx_counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.active_txns </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"