"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 场景 3: 跨多行一致性读取 → Repeatable Read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 需要整个事务期间看到一致的快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 两次读取必须基于同一快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"应用层实现最终一致性\">应用层实现最终一致性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class EventualConsistencyPattern:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;应用层实现最终一致性的常见模式&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    async def write_with_retry(self, key, value):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;写入失败重试 + 幂等性&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        idempotency_key = generate_uuid()&#10;        for attempt in range(3):&#10;            try:&#10;                await self.store.put(key, value, idempotency_key)&#10;                return&#10;            except TimeoutError:&#10;                await asyncio.sleep(2 ** attempt)&#10;        # 最后尝试失败: 写入补偿队列&#10;        await self.compensation_queue.enqueue(key, value)&#10;&#10;    async def read_with_fallback(self, key):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;多副本读取 + 降级&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        try:&#10;            return await self.primary.get(key)&#10;        except NodeUnavailable:&#10;            # 降级: 从可能过期的副本读取&#10;            result = await self.replica.get(key)&#10;            result[&#39;_stale&#39;] = True  # 标记可能过期&#10;            return result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventualConsistencyPattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"应用层实现最终一致性的常见模式\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write_with_retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"写入失败重试 + 幂等性\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generate_uuid()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.store.put(key, value, idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TimeoutError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 最后尝试失败: 写入补偿队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.compensation_queue.enqueue(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read_with_fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"多副本读取 + 降级\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.primary.get(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeUnavailable:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 降级: 从可能过期的副本读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.replica.get(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'_stale'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 标记可能过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"隔离级别选择指南\">隔离级别选择指南</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务场景</th>\n<th>推荐隔离级别</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金融转账</td>\n<td>Serializable 或 SELECT FOR UPDATE</td>\n<td>不允许任何并发异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存扣减</td>\n<td>Repeatable Read + 乐观锁</td>\n<td>CAS 操作保护关键更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户注册（唯一性）</td>\n<td>Read Committed + UNIQUE 约束</td>\n<td>数据库约束保证正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报表统计</td>\n<td>Read Committed</td>\n<td>允许看到并发提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交动态流</td>\n<td>Eventual Consistency</td>\n<td>短暂延迟可接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"避免常见陷阱\">避免常见陷阱</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>不要假设默认隔离级别</strong>：MySQL 默认 Repeatable Read，PostgreSQL 默认 Read Committed</li>\n<li><strong>长事务是性能杀手</strong>：MVCC 需要保留长事务开始后的所有版本</li>\n<li><strong>FOR UPDATE 不等于 Serializable</strong>：只锁定已存在的行，不防止幻读</li>\n<li><strong>乐观锁需要重试逻辑</strong>：版本冲突时必须在应用层重试</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"混合一致性架构\">混合一致性架构</h3><p>现代系统常采用分层一致性策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"写入路径: ACID (强一致, 经过主数据库)&#10;  ↓ CDC (Change Data Capture)&#10;异步同步: 最终一致性 (同步到搜索索引、缓存、数仓)&#10;  ↓&#10;读取路径: 根据场景选择&#10;  - 关键读取 → 主库 (强一致)&#10;  - 普通读取 → 从库/缓存 (最终一致)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>写入路径: ACID (强一致, 经过主数据库)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓ CDC (Change Data Capture)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>异步同步: 最终一致性 (同步到搜索索引、缓存、数仓)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>读取路径: 根据场景选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 关键读取 → 主库 (强一致)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 普通读取 → 从库/缓存 (最终一致)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>默认隔离级别</th>\n<th>最高隔离级别</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>Read Committed</td>\n<td>Serializable (SSI)</td>\n<td>MVCC + SSI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL InnoDB</td>\n<td>Repeatable Read</td>\n<td>Serializable (2PL)</td>\n<td>MVCC + 间隙锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>Serializable</td>\n<td>Serializable</td>\n<td>SSI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TiDB</td>\n<td>Repeatable Read (SI)</td>\n<td>不支持 Serializable</td>\n<td>Percolator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spanner</td>\n<td>外部一致性</td>\n<td>外部一致性</td>\n<td>TrueTime + 2PL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DynamoDB</td>\n<td>最终一致性</td>\n<td>强一致性读</td>\n<td>Quorum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>Read Committed</td>\n<td>Snapshot</td>\n<td>WiredTiger MVCC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>ACID 和 BASE 代表了事务语义的两端，但实际工程中大多数系统处于两者之间的某个位置。关键认知是：一致性是有代价的——更强的一致性保证意味着更高的延迟和更低的吞吐。工程师的核心能力在于识别业务场景的真实一致性需求，选择恰好满足需求的最弱一致性级别，从而在正确性和性能之间取得最优平衡。</p>\n<p>在 2026 年的实践中，SSI（可序列化快照隔离）正在成为主流选择——它以接近 Read Committed 的性能提供 Serializable 的保证（低冲突场景下），CockroachDB 和 PostgreSQL 都默认或推荐使用 SSI。这使得&quot;默认 Serializable&quot;成为可能，大大简化了应用开发者的心智负担。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ACID 与 BASE：事务语义对比","id":"acid-与-base-事务语义对比"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"ACID 特性精确定义","id":"acid-特性精确定义"},{"level":3,"text":"隔离级别与异常现象","id":"隔离级别与异常现象"},{"level":3,"text":"可序列化实现方案","id":"可序列化实现方案"},{"level":3,"text":"BASE 模型","id":"base-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"MVCC（多版本并发控制）实现","id":"mvcc-多版本并发控制-实现"},{"level":3,"text":"选择隔离级别的决策框架","id":"选择隔离级别的决策框架"},{"level":3,"text":"应用层实现最终一致性","id":"应用层实现最终一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"隔离级别选择指南","id":"隔离级别选择指南"},{"level":3,"text":"避免常见陷阱","id":"避免常见陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"混合一致性架构","id":"混合一致性架构"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"复制一致性与共识算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/consistency-and-consensus"},"next":{"title":"分布式事务实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/distributed-transactions"}}